{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>早上8時許，警方接報指，一輛客貨車在置富南區廣場駛出置富道時，撞倒一名正橫過斑馬線的老婦。消防及救護員接報到場，隨即將已陷昏迷的73歲姓方老婦送往瑪麗醫院搶救。警方經調查後，36歲姓何客貨車司機涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人身體受嚴重傷害被捕，現正被扣留調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:53:50.296640+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:11:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:05:12.296481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:47:18.064277+00:00","content_hash":"dfcb949e65383deda4d19de2cedde7cc77e26bfaec6cc898c44b3a179201287d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}